      "strength": "context",
      "state": "not_found",
      "retention": "Only switches still in the Defender log as it stands. It holds up to 16 MiB by default and overwrites its oldest records, and a cleared log holds none. If the Defender log is not there at all — Defender removed from the image, or the file deleted — this row also says not found, because this check does not know which logs a PC should have; the rules on Defender's service and platform folder answer that."
    },
